WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.121 --> 00:00:02.087
- I'm a very slow typer.

00:00:02.087 --> 00:00:04.339
- That's part of why
we're parents. (laughter)

00:00:08.768 --> 00:00:10.346
- There's a bunch of 'em.

00:00:12.036 --> 00:00:14.049
- It's making me very emojinal.

00:00:16.017 --> 00:00:17.330
- Is there a translator?

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.604
- There's such a thing
as too many options.

00:00:22.251 --> 00:00:23.941
- This might take a lot
longer than I thought.

00:00:24.174 --> 00:00:26.069
- Young people do this,
so that they could hide

00:00:26.069 --> 00:00:27.853
their conversations from their parents.

00:00:27.853 --> 00:00:30.147
- I don't know if I'm
spelling this correctly.

00:00:31.735 --> 00:00:33.451
I know, I don't know. (laughter)

00:00:33.576 --> 00:00:35.318
- This is so stupid, I don't know how

00:00:35.318 --> 00:00:36.246
to communicate like this.

00:00:36.246 --> 00:00:37.872
- Okay, I'm sendin' it.

00:00:37.872 --> 00:00:40.917
- Okay, Sabrina sent me
something with just two emojis.

00:00:41.668 --> 00:00:44.253
- A dog.
- Oh, doggone.

00:00:44.587 --> 00:00:48.550
(laughter) There's an arrow.

00:00:48.979 --> 00:00:51.386
- (laughter) We've picked the same one.

00:00:51.386 --> 00:00:52.887
- Did you pick up the mail.
- Yeah.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.171
- Okay, then look over with mine.

00:00:55.171 --> 00:00:57.058
- Okay.
- Figure what mine is.

00:00:57.058 --> 00:00:58.392
- Oh God, I'm in trouble.

00:00:58.392 --> 00:01:00.061
- You're always coming home from running--

00:01:00.061 --> 00:01:01.062
- All right, here's mine.

00:01:01.062 --> 00:01:02.812
- So I'm like, it's like this,
hm, you're still running?

00:01:03.512 --> 00:01:05.150
- Fist?
- No.

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:06.819
- Man, you wrote it out long.

00:01:06.819 --> 00:01:09.460
- I can't see the emoji, it's so small.

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:10.427
- This?
- Do you know

00:01:10.427 --> 00:01:11.802
how small these are, over here?

00:01:11.802 --> 00:01:13.157
- Okay, now you are the opposite of me,

00:01:13.157 --> 00:01:14.993
when you have one, two,
three, four, five, six,

00:01:14.993 --> 00:01:17.913
seven, eight, nine, 10, 11,
12, 13, 14, 15, 16 emojis.

00:01:17.913 --> 00:01:19.081
- I'm an overachiever.

00:01:19.081 --> 00:01:20.499
- Is it a letter?
- Uh huh.

00:01:20.499 --> 00:01:21.624
- So mail?

00:01:21.624 --> 00:01:23.751
- Uh huh, that was
supposed to be, not a car,

00:01:23.751 --> 00:01:25.351
it was supposed to be a pickup.

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:26.849
- Oh, I got it, I got it, I got it.

00:01:26.849 --> 00:01:28.924
Hey, you lady going to
the store in your minivan,

00:01:28.924 --> 00:01:30.341
buy me all these foods.

00:01:30.341 --> 00:01:31.927
- That's right. Are
you going to the store?

00:01:31.927 --> 00:01:33.195
- There's a car.

00:01:33.195 --> 00:01:35.137
- Well, I couldn't find a pickup.

00:01:35.137 --> 00:01:36.347
- Well, how'm I supposed to.

00:01:36.347 --> 00:01:40.142
- I put the eggplant in there
just to be sassy. (laughter)

00:01:40.143 --> 00:01:44.272
- I only have four
characters, to your what, 12?

00:01:44.272 --> 00:01:45.440
- Plant in emoji stands--
- For eggplant?

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:47.842
- for penis.
- Does it?

00:01:47.842 --> 00:01:49.705
- Does it, really? (laughter)

00:01:49.705 --> 00:01:51.910
Oh my gosh, kids today are so dirty!

00:01:54.032 --> 00:01:55.200
- It was hard.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.995
- I'm better at it than I
thought, that's my takeaway.

00:01:57.995 --> 00:01:59.704
- I don't know, I just don't get it.

00:01:59.704 --> 00:02:01.790
I mean, it makes sense on
Instagram, when you're like

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:04.033
tryin' to express an
emotion, with an emoji.

00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:06.450
But, why would you like,
try to communicate?

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.921
- I don't think this is for me.

00:02:07.921 --> 00:02:09.297
- It's not for me either.

00:02:09.297 --> 00:02:11.967
- Maybe that's what emoji's really about,

00:02:11.967 --> 00:02:15.177
is helping us get closer
to emotional communication,

00:02:15.177 --> 00:02:17.545
through brain implants.

